// REQUIRES: long
// P03.22 Done-when size for the hierarchy checks: the `fresh` shape of
// extends-stress.test at 200000 types, one test per shape so lit runs the
// shapes in parallel. Near-linear:
// Inputs/check-linear.py: N/16 and N, N at most 48 times the CPU time; a
// quadratic check takes 256 times.
// RUN: %python %S/Inputs/check-linear.py --label extends-stress-fresh --out %t.lin1 --n 200000 --gen "%S/Inputs/gen-extends-stress.py fresh {n}" -- %gopp check -check-j=1 {file}
package main
